    "body": "`verify_ecdsa` reads `sig[1]` before it checks `len(sig) < 4`, so a 0- or 1-byte signature raises `IndexError` instead of returning `False`, which the comment promises for any DER encoding error.\n\nMove the length check ahead of the byte access, and add a regression test.\n",
